The HTML parsing algorithm is published by WHATWG at https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html .

html5lib-tests1.dat is copied unchanged from html5lib/html5lib-tests commit f994590f528ac8b6073665791ddb1ed85c66dfb2. Its MIT license is retained as html5lib-LICENSE.

